---
title: "treasury_into_supply (Sui Framework: coin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: TreasuryCap(id, total_supply) destructured
    q_destruct --> q_delete: id.delete()
    q_delete --> [*]: return total_supply (Supply object)

    note right of q_destruct
        INV-001: operation is irreversible - Supply cannot become TreasuryCap again
        INV-002: TreasuryCap destroyed - no more coin metadata updates possible
        INV-003: Supply retains minting/burning capability via increase/decrease_supply
    end note
